# Unsubtle Mockery deals 4 damage to Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2), which dies, then Bot1 surveils 1: the Mountain on top of the library
# goes to the graveyard, so Bot1's graveyard is the Mockery and the Mountain.

[Bot1 Deck]
Unsubtle Mockery
Black Lotus
Island x6
Mountain
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Grizzly Bears
Black Lotus
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Unsubtle Mockery.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears; Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsubtle Mockery; Mountain; Black Lotus
